# Pipeline scratch. api.py writes cdif_skos.json and Mapper.py writes the
# two dds files, once per input file -- which is why batch processing is
# serial. Whatever they hold after a run is just the last file processed,
# so tracking them produced a diff on every run that meant nothing.
resources/cdif_skos.json
resources/cdif_dds.jsonld
resources/cdif_dds_framed.jsonld

